%% Oversized atomic unit splitting contract.

flowchart TD
    A[Atomic ChildUnit]
    B{Within size limit?}
    C[Keep one Child]
    D{Unit type?}

    E[Numbered/lettered item,<br/>bullet group, or paragraph]
    F[Split only inside this unit<br/>using safe text boundaries]
    G[Keep logical_item_key or logical_item_keys,<br/>parent_item_key, heading_path,<br/>item_path, split_index/count]

    H[Markdown table]
    I[Split by row groups]
    J[Repeat header + separator]
    K[Do not cut a row<br/>share logical_table_key]

    L[Fenced code]
    M[Split at line boundaries]
    N[Repeat valid opening/closing fence]
    O[Do not parse code internals<br/>share logical_code_key]

    P[Emit split ChildUnits<br/>in source order]

    A --> B
    B -->|yes| C --> P
    B -->|no| D
    D -->|item or paragraph| E --> F --> G --> P
    D -->|table| H --> I --> J --> K --> P
    D -->|code| L --> M --> N --> O --> P

    Q{{Never cross Parent boundary}} -. invariant .-> P
    R{{Never merge numbered/lettered markers<br/>bullet grouping only occurs before split<br/>under the grouping rule}} -. invariant .-> P
    S{{No generic splitter<br/>across table rows or code lines}} -. invariant .-> P
